            {
                "Id": "GooglePubSubAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite",
                "Name": "Google Pub/Sub Adapter for SAP Integration Suite",
                "ResourceId": "917753da76fe44f5a392e8cf369d0a2c",
                "Description": "<p>The GooglePubSub adapter facilitates and accelerates the implementation time of connecting to Google Pub/Sub. The adapter is available only for Standard service plans and above of the SAP Integration Suite. For more information, see SAP Note <a href=\"https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/3188446\" rel=\"nofollow\">3188446</a>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Receiver adapter allows reliable <strong>publishing</strong> of messages to Google Pub/Sub. It offers single message (<strong>Basic</strong>) and multiple message publishing<strong> </strong>(<strong>Advanced</strong>) capabilities.</li>\n<li>Support for listing Topics with&nbsp;<strong>pagination</strong> using <strong>Page Token.</strong></li>\n<li>Allows you to modify the acknowledgement deadline of a message using the <strong>Modify Acknowledgement Deadline </strong>operation<strong>.</strong></li>\n<li>Sender adapter allows&nbsp;<strong>consuming</strong> messages from Google Pub/Sub. You can read messages in real time <strong>(gRPC)</strong> or using a specified polling interval <strong>(REST)</strong>.</li>\n<li>Provides&nbsp;<strong>multiple post-processing </strong>options: <em>Acknowledge after Successful Processing</em>, <em>Acknowledge Immediately</em>, and <em>Do not Acknowledge</em>.</li>\n<li>Support for On-Premise Connectivity.</li>\n<li>Offers secure authentication via&nbsp;<strong>OAuth2 Service Account </strong>option (uses Key Pair authentication) and <strong>Workload Identity Federation</strong>.</li>\n<li>Support for <strong>decoding data for incoming messages</strong> in Sender Adapter (REST variant only).&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Documentation:</strong></p>\n<p>All documentation, including the User Guide, and Release Notes are included in the documentation tab of this package.</p>\n<p><strong>Download Location:</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;To install the Adapter, refer to the Adapter Guide located in the <strong>Documents </strong>tab.</p>",
                "ShortText": "This package includes the GooglePubSub Adapter and its documentation. The GooglePubSub adapter is an adapter available on SAP Integration Suite that facilitates message publishing and subscription via Google Pub/Sub.",
                "Version": "1.2.1",
                "Vendor": "SAP",
                "PartnerContent": false,
                "UpdateAvailable": false,
                "Mode": "READ_ONLY",
                "SupportedPlatform": "Cloud Integration",
