            {
                "Id": "JiraAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite",
                "Name": "Jira Adapter for SAP Integration Suite",
                "ResourceId": "fc8b33857d664f659cd93b7639eef415",
                "Description": "<p>The Jira Adapter facilitates and accelerates the implementation time and reduces the complexity of connecting to Jira. The adapter is available only for Standard service plans and above of the SAP Integration Suite. For more information, see SAP Note <a href=\"https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/3188446\" rel=\"nofollow\">3188446</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Feature highlights:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Jira Operations Support:</strong> Offers support for all issue tracking and project operations.</li>\n<li><strong>Dynamic configuration with headers and properties:</strong><em>&nbsp;</em>Assigning dynamic values to different properties allows enhanced flexibility to your integration flows.</li>\n<li><strong>Support for JQL Query:</strong>&nbsp;You can perform advanced querying for CRUD(Create, Read, Update, Delete) operations using JQL query.</li>\n<li><strong>Ease of Access and Connectivity:</strong>&nbsp;Save connection related details on our platform to simplify operations and connectivity.&nbsp;</li>\n<li><strong>Configuration Type:</strong> Supports <strong>Basic </strong>configuration type that provides a convenient processing capability for supported versions, whereas <strong>Advanced </strong>enables proficient users to perform calls with greater control while connecting to any API endpoint.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Documentation:</strong></p>\n<p>All documentation, including the User Guide, and Release Notes are included in the <strong>Documents </strong>tab of this package.</p>\n<p><strong>Download Location:</strong></p>\n<p>To install the Adapter, refer to the Adapter Guide located in the Documents tab.</p>",
                "ShortText": "This package includes the Jira Adapter and its documentation. The Jira Adapter facilitates and accelerates the implementation time and reduces the complexity of connecting to Jira.",
                "Version": "1.1.0",
                "Vendor": "SAP",
