            {
                "Id": "SAPS4HANACloudIntegrationwithServiceNow",
                "Name": "SAP S/4HANA Cloud Integration with ServiceNow",
                "ResourceId": "a75844f5bdb545e2af4a20aaeefd4f1c",
                "Description": "<p>This package supports the integration of SAP S/4HANA Cloud with ServiceNow.<br>It has the following integration flows:</p>\n<ol>\n <li>Replicates Users from SAP S/4HANA Cloud to ServiceNow.</li>\n <li>Replicates Cost Centers from SAP S/4HANA Cloud to ServiceNow.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Exception Handling</strong>:</p>\n<p>During Integration Process, any exception raised is captured and sent via email.</p>\n<p><strong>Note</strong>:<br>This package uses basic authentication for ServiceNow. In case you prefer to use OAuth, configure ServiceNow accordingly. Details for the configuration can be found in the ServiceNow adapter Guide.</p>",
                "ShortText": "This package supports the integration of SAP S/4HANA Cloud with ServiceNow. It has Integration Flows to synchronize users and cost centers.",
