            {
                "Id": "ServiceNow",
                "Name": "SAP S/4HANA Integration with ServiceNow API",
                "ResourceId": "6d7b1d71d3694c4e97304ecbd97cf6d4",
                "Description": "<p>SAP S/4HANA Integration with ServiceNow API integration flow helps in creating ServiceNow Tickets by taking XML input over HTTPs endpoints. The HTTP endpoints will be generated once the integration flows will be deployed in the tenant.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>ServiceNow is a cloud-based workflow automation platform that enables enterprise organizations to improve operational efficiencies by streaming and automating routine work tasks and creating tickets.</p>\n<p>This interface can be used by any business scenarios or systems capable of invoking web services like DOST Add-on&reg;\ufe0f.</p>\n<p>For more details/support contact Abusiness Support Email- Support@abusinesstech.com</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
                "ShortText": "Abusiness package delivers iflow to create a ticket in the ServiceNow application. ServiceNow Access variable is externalized and must be maintained by the user.",
