            {
                "Id": "ServiceNowAdapter",
                "Name": "ServiceNow Adapter for SAP Integration Suite",
                "ResourceId": "51772143d916449e8b5e83684eb83861",
                "Description": "<p><strong>Feature highlights:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Supports Basic and OAuth2 as authentication mechanisms to connect to ServiceNow.</li>\n <li>Support for multiple API versions.</li>\n <li>Supports multiple operations, including CRUD operations on ServiceNow tables.</li>\n <li>Supports for multiple attachment operations including uploading of files.</li>\n <li>Supports outbound headers.</li>\n <li>Supports pagination.</li>\n <li>Supports dynamic configuration with headers and properties.</li>\n <li>Support for XML and JSON formats.</li>\n <li>XSD generation: the adapter comes equipped with an Eclipse Plug-in which generates XSDs representing the object in ServiceNow.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Documentation:</strong></p>\n<p>All documentation, including the Installation Guide, User Guide, and Release Notes are included in the documentation tab of this package.</p>\n<p><strong>Download Location:</strong></p>\n<p>To download the SAP ServiceNow Adapter's Eclipse Plug-In or Workbench, navigate to: <a href=\"https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/softwarecenter\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/softwarecenter</a>&nbsp;&gt;&gt; SUPPORT PACKAGES &amp; PATCHES By Alphabetical Index (A-Z) &gt;&gt;&nbsp;C &gt;&gt;&nbsp;look for \u201c<strong>SAP CP IS ADAPTER ADVANCE PACK</strong>\u201d.</p>\n<p>Alternatively, you can directly go to:</p>\n<ul>\n <li><a href=\"https://eur03.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flaunchpad.support.sap.com%2F%23%2Fsoftwarecenter%2Ftemplate%2Fproducts%2F_APP%3D00200682500000001943%26_EVENT%3DNEXT%26HEADER%3DY%26FUNCTIONBAR%3DY%26EVENT%3DTREE%26NE%3DNAVIGATE%26ENR%3D73555000100800003071%26V%3DMAINT%26TA%3DACTUAL%2FSAP%2520CP%2520IS%2520ADAPTER%2520ADVANCE%2520PACK&amp;data=04%7C01%7Cjohn.bilay%40rojoconsultancy.com%7C514b303c7b6a4903e49708d8a0d0c4f2%7C920d0ff2113441eca952e6c5ca6532c1%7C0%7C0%7C637436165801744392%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C1000&amp;sdata=hr4z9GRGDN1%2FhvvE1i%2FmyqbGhUotS5hK%2BjtuBPejytw%3D&amp;reserved=0\" rel=\"nofollow\">SAP CP IS ADAPTER ADVANCE PACK</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Please note that the content of the package is the Eclipse Plug-In or Workbench. To install the Adapter, refer to the Adapter Installation Guide located in the Documents tab.</p>\n<p>This package is accessible to customers with an SAP Integration Suite standard and premium edition.</p>",
